# HueyOS optional post-migration GPU fragment for Linux 7.3.4.
#
# Do NOT merge this into the first testing1 build. Use ONLY after the live
# Debian system has been shown to boot to the Intel UHD 770 (i915) desktop,
# the RX 570 has been safely removed, and the NVIDIA V100 compute path works.
#
# Preserve i915 with Intel firmware, console/DRM, GNOME/Wayland and fallback.
# The NVIDIA R580 proprietary modules are built separately for KERNELRELEASE.
# No actual PCIe bandwidth/slot or power saving comes from disabling AMDGPU;
# that comes from physically removing the RX 570.
#
# This delta avoids compiling an unused AMD graphics module in *future*
# candidates. It is not a requirement for the first test build.
CONFIG_DRM_I915=m
# CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_NOUVEAU is not set
